upon the faithless. The Tef-Aabhi believe it a disease in the Lifeweb. The Maa-Kep insist it comes from the poisonous thoughts of traitors. Whatever it's origins, the Light Overwhelming disrupts the Sahu of Mummies afflicted by it. Light pours forth from the Mummy, marking them as a clearly supernatural being. This light bloats out everything within the Mummy\u2019s senses and renders them terrifying to anyone who falls victim to their Sybaris.<br /> <b>Systems:</b> Mummies afflicted by the Akhu Unbound suffer a -2 penalty on all rolls to perceive their surroundings. Any failures the Mummy accrues during Khepher investigations are dramatic failures that do not grant Beats instead. Sybaris triggers related to the Mummy cause Sybaris one stage higher than they normally would.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","co