alty. On the other hand, even the most loyal Ba tends towards obsession and they have difficulty relating to humans. The Ba doesn\u2019t care that a cultist needs to feed their family when there is heresy to be punished. While a single ghost is hardly a direct threat to one of the Arisen, a pissed off one is still more than capable of making the lives of Immortals and cultists miserable. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Wandering Ba</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Rank 2 Ghost</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Virtue:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Determined</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Vice:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Vengeful</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Aspiration:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Find its body</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Anchors:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> The Ba\u2019s tomb, the Ba\u2019s cultist descendant</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Attributes:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Power 2 Finesse 7 Resistance 5</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Influence:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Anchor 2</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Corpus:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> 7</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Willpower:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">10</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Speed: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">11</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Size:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Defence:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">2</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Initiative:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">+12</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Numina:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Avernian Gateway, Blast, Hypnotic Gaze (DP), Immortal Ba*, Speed, Telekinesis</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Manifestations</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>:</b> Twilight Form, Image, Materialize </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Essence:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">15</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ban:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Cannot harm anyone who offers it food until it finishes eating. </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bane:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Eye of Horus. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>New Numen - Immortal Ba: </i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Mummies may invest Ba Pillars into the ghost as if it were a Sadikh. The ghost may hold a number of Pillar points up to its Rank and an invested ghost benefits from their master\u2019s Soul Affinities and Mortal Decrees </span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-17T14:16:15-08:00",